[HELP_LF_TRAVEL_RANGE]
Left front suspension travel range.

This is the suspension travel before it 
hits the bumpstops. 

With a higher value the suspension has
more travel before it eventually hits 
the bumpstop

With a lower value you hit the bumpstop
sooner, thus blocking the suspension
travel.

Check the bumpstop rate help to understand
what happens when you the suspension
hits a bumpstop.

[HELP_RF_TRAVEL_RANGE]
Right front suspension travel range.

This is the suspension travel before it 
hits the bumpstops. 

With a higher value the suspension has
more travel before it eventually hits 
the bumpstop

With a lower value you hit the bumpstop
sooner, thus blocking the suspension
travel.

Check the bumpstop rate help to understand
what happens when you the suspension
hits a bumpstop.

